l Park is one of the most important protected areas i\"}]]}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"flash-flood-disaster-in-nepal-2026\",{\"className\":\"news-content\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"style\":{\"color\":\"inherit\"},\"href\":\"/blog/flash-flood-disaster-in-nepal-2026/\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"className\":\"shadow\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#f5f5f5\",\"padding\":\"12px 0px\",\"borderRadius\":\"10px\",\"rowGap\":\"1rem\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"md\":4,\"style\":{\"width\":\"auto\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"news-img position-relative\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L59\",null,{\"alt\":\"Flash Flood disaster in Nepal, 2026\",\"sizes\":\"25vw\",\"className\":\"object-fit-cover scale-ui-on-hover\",\"src\":\"https://destination.missionsummittreks.com/images/20260830061817.png\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"style\":{\"flex\":2},\"className\":\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-between\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"news-title two-line-clamp\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\"},\"children\":\"Flash Flood disaster in Nepal, 2026\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"news-desc two-line-clamp\",\"children\":\"A flash flood is defined as sudden, fast-moving water that begins within three hours or 6 hours o\"}]]}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"broad-peak-avalanche-2026\",{\"className\":\"news-content\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{\"style\":{\"color\":\"inherit\"},\"href\":\"/blog/broad-peak-avalanche-2026/\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"className\":\"shadow\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#f5f5f5\",\"padding\":\"12px 0px\",\"borderRadius\":\"10px\",\"rowGap\":\"1rem\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"md\":4,\"style\":{\"width\":\"auto\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"news-img position-relative\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L59\",null,{\"alt\":\"Broad Peak Avalanche 2026\",\"sizes\":\"25vw\",\"className\":\"